target        : h3
payload       : our image verbatim, kernel padded to 0x92000, park there, code0 far branch, text_offset 0x80000, image_size 0x93000
code0         : +0x92000
expected      : park at a far offset, text_offset 0x80000
proves        : a far landing with a truthful image_size works, i.e. the ABL honours text_offset/image_size instead of requiring a near entry
if refused    : if refused: entry distance or text_offset handling -> H4, then F1
os_version    : 0x1c000185 (stock)
partition     : 100663296 B
flash         : boot_b, restore_image backup/64f70df8/boot_b.img between runs
measure       : tooling/50-boot-timing.sh, plateau vs the stock control
